### Get current user profile

# Get all properties
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/properties/a6f45a0f-2328-47f1-be16-dfdf0e8698ed
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

# Search properties
GET {{baseUrl}}/properties/search?listingType=RENT
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

